Ok, I guess I hadn't mentioned that as one of my possible interpretations

So if I see "lo broda be ko cu brode"  I should just think of that as "act
in such a way as to make 'lo broda be do cu brode' a true statement"....  I
think I can accept that.  I'll just have to be more careful when I see ko's
inside nested bridi.
